    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Re:AEGIS \u2606<br><br>You're an advanced combat android, and now is your time to show what you are capable of doing. Show all those that challenge you in cyberspace who is the dominant machine.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle against countless enemies inside a Y2K-inspired cyberspace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face various types of enemies and learn their unique behaviors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat bosses to earn unique character upgrades to greatly influence your run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls and game loop for quick play sessions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy an endless mode to see how long you last against an endless swarm.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Re:AEGIS \u2606<br><br>You're an advanced combat android, and now is your time to show what you are capable of doing. Show all those that challenge you in cyberspace who is the dominant machine.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle against countless enemies inside a Y2K-inspired cyberspace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face various types of enemies and learn their unique behaviors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat bosses to earn unique character upgrades to greatly influence your run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls and game loop for quick play sessions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy an endless mode to see how long you last against an endless swarm.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Re:AEGIS is a retro-inspired survivors-like 3D arena shooter where you play as a combat android fighting against hordes of machines in a Y2K-inspired cyberspace. Defeat bosses, gain upgrades, and show all machines that challenge your strength.",
